# HB-NONE (remake phase 1, 2026-10-11): the generated hitboxes were removed on purpose; animation, sound, movement and timing stay.
# The owner authors this move's hitbox by hand in the Workbench; its strike window is gameplay.json "strike" (timing metadata only).
# COMBO (geno 11): XV2 light string hit 3. Clip GOK_ATC_017 = BAC GOK_PLAYER 302 (BCM 0/18/3/3). BAC hit f12 dur 4 -> wait_until 12, 4 frames.
# The step is held through the hit window (XV2's movement record ends at the hit frame; held 4 frames longer).
# Limb: foot.L reaches +9.04 Z (chest-relative) at f12 (combo/limbs.py). String hit: set knockback (fkb 10, kbg 60: the same push at every percent, as fighting-game string hits and many Ultimate
# light hits are) at 361,
# HBSTUN keeps the next link (Light4, hit at its f12, window from f15) a true combo; damage/kb are Melee design values.
PUT ANIM_RATE 1.0
# XV2 BAC Movement event f2 dur 10 (BAC 302); the step is GROUND_VEL x FACING, a design speed (the BAC record's speed is not decoded)
wait_until 2
GET ra_f:0 FACING
MUL ra_f:0 1.2
PUT GROUND_VEL ra_f:0
wait_until 7
GET ra_f:0 FACING
MUL ra_f:0 1.2
PUT GROUND_VEL ra_f:0
wait_until 12
GET ra_f:0 FACING
MUL ra_f:0 1.2
PUT GROUND_VEL ra_f:0
wait_until 16
PUT GROUND_VEL 0
wait_until 35
iasa
